## time.soar -- agent-world: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate state time -> sets time.
sp {agent-world*elaborate*state*time
   :default
   (state <s> ^superstate nil
              ^io.input-link.time.ms <time-ms>
              ^world <w>)
   (<w> ^real true)
-->
   (log 1 (crlf) |Time: | <time-ms>)
   (<w> ^time <time-ms>)
}
